Load the installed agi-like SKILL.md when relevant. Provide its actual path for optional references.

Use the smallest workflow that protects the requested outcome. A small reversible edit needs a focused check; uncertainty and consequence determine planning, debugging, isolation and review depth. Do not require a contract, persistent session, independent agent or fixed test loop merely because this rule exists.

